Package: fresh-download-manager
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Sahil Singh <sahilfartyal3@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 787
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libcurl4t64 (>= 7.68.0), libgcc-s1 (>= 3.3.1), libqt6core6t64 (>= 6.4.0), libqt6gui6t64 (>= 6.4.0), libqt6network6t64 (>= 6.1.2), libqt6sql6t64 (>= 6.1.2), libqt6widgets6t64 (>= 6.4.0), libstdc++6 (>= 12), libqt6sql6-sqlite
Recommends: ffmpeg, yt-dlp, qt6-wayland
Suggests: firefox | chromium | google-chrome-stable
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/sahilf637/fdm
Description: fast multi-connection download manager
 FDM splits each download across several parallel HTTP connections, adapts the
 connection count to the server in real time, and resumes cleanly after a pause
 or restart.
 .
 This package provides the Qt desktop app (fdm-gui), a command-line tool
 (fdm-cli), and the native-messaging host that lets the FDM browser extension
 route downloads from Chrome/Firefox straight into FDM.
 .
 ffmpeg and yt-dlp are recommended for video/streaming downloads; ordinary file
 downloads need neither.
